sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant REST as REST Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>8081/TCP
    participant DP as DataPlane<br/>Handler Layer
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime<br/>(e.g. sklearn, xgboost)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,Runtime: Inference Request Flow (REST)
    Client->>KRBP: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OAuth/SA)
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate OpenShift<br/>OAuth/ServiceAccount Token
    KRBP->>REST: Forward authenticated request<br/>HTTP/8080
    REST->>DP: Route to model handler
    DP->>Runtime: Execute inference
    Runtime-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>REST: Response payload
    REST-->>KRBP: JSON Response
    KRBP-->>Client: 200 OK + Prediction

    Note over Client,Runtime: Inference Request Flow (gRPC)
    Client->>KRBP: GRPCInferenceService/ModelInfer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OAuth/SA)
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate Token
    KRBP->>GRPC: Forward authenticated request<br/>gRPC/8081
    GRPC->>DP: Route to model handler
    DP->>Runtime: Execute inference
    Runtime-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>GRPC: Response
    GRPC-->>KRBP: gRPC Response
    KRBP-->>Client: Prediction Result

    Note over Client,Runtime: Model Lifecycle
    Client->>KRBP: POST /v2/repository/models/{model}/load
    KRBP->>REST: Forward load request
    REST->>DP: Load model
    DP->>DP: Check trusted-runtimes.json<br/>allowlist
    alt Runtime allowed
        DP->>Runtime: Instantiate model implementation
        Runtime-->>DP: Model loaded
        DP-->>REST: Success
        REST-->>Client: 200 OK
    else Runtime blocked
        DP-->>REST: Rejected (untrusted runtime)
        REST-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    Note over Metrics,Prom: Observability
    REST->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC)<br/>Excludes health endpoints
    GRPC->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC)<br/>Excludes health endpoints
    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8082
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
